{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"水平截线与等高线：以 z=x²+y² 为例","goals":["能够说明固定输出高度 z=h 如何在曲面上截出空间曲线及其在 xy 平面上的投影圆","掌握从截面方程 x²+y²=h 推导投影圆半径 r=√h 的方法及定义域边界条件（h≥0）","理解动态投影圆与静态等高线图的关系，并预告下一节垂直截线（固定输入变量）"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["问题驱动：从方程 z=x²+y² 出发建立三维曲面与二维截面关系","同步对照：三维曲面截线与二维投影圆双视图联动","先心算预测后动画验证：在进行高度变化演示前让学生预测半径变化"]},"variables":[{"as":"number_01","initial":1,"min":0,"max":4,"label":"截面高度 h","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.02}}],"tasks":[{"as":"section-04-task-01","prompt":"想让投影圆的半径为 √3，请先算出需要的高度，再调节高度验证。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["根据推导公式，投影圆半径为 r = √h，反过来高度与半径的关系是 h = r²。","将 r = √3 代入公式 h = r² 计算出需要的高度 h。"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"回答正确！因为 (√3)² = 3，所以当高度调节到 3 时，投影圆半径刚好为 √3。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":3,"tolerance":0.01},"start":{"kind":"practice","variables":["number_01"],"values":{"number_01":1}}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-01","purpose":"建立三维曲面 z=x²+y² 与水平截面 z=h 的直观模型，并生成平面投影","beats":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"当我们看到多元函数方程 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方时，怎样才能直观读懂它的曲面形状呢？直接想象整个三维空间可能有些困难，但我们可以先固定输出高度。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"研究曲面方法","items":["固定输出高度 z = h","观察截面交线及其投影"]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-01:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"请看三维曲面图，这是 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方的旋转抛物面。我们引入一个水平截面，显式设定高度 z 等于 1。截面与曲面相交，在空间中形成了一条封闭的环形交线。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:1:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","kind":"scene3d","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"曲面 z=x²+y² 与截面 z=h","fallback":"函数曲面 z=x^2 + y^2 与可变截面。","axes":true,"camera":{"yaw":0.72,"pitch":0.55,"zoom":1},"objects":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:surface","kind":"surface","label":"z=x^2 + y^2","color":"teal","expression":"x^2 + y^2","x_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"y_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"samples":12}],"sections":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:section","axis":"z","value":1,"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:surface"],"display":"plane_and_intersection","label":"截面","color":"orange"}],"bindings":[{"target":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:section.value","expression":"number_01"}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3-region"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:1:2:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"引导学习者观察高度 h=1 时的空间截线"}}]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-01:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"为了更清楚地研究这条交线的形状，我们把它垂直投影到 xy 平面上。二维坐标图展示的就是投影结果，它是一个以原点为圆心的标准圆，其半径随着高度 h 实时联动。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:1:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01","kind":"geometry","role":"comparison_visual","content":{"title":"xy 平面投影圆","axes":{"x":{"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"y"},"equal_scale":true},"points":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01:fragment:center","x":0,"y":0,"label":"(0, 0)"}],"circles":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01:fragment:circle","center":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01:fragment:center","radius":1,"label":"半径 r"}],"bindings":[{"target":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01:fragment:circle.radius","expression":"sqrt(number_01)","label":{"prefix":"r = ","precision":2},"allow_zero":true}]},"placement":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3-region"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:1:3:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-02","purpose":"代数推导交线方程 x²+y²=h 与半径 r=√h，解释空间截线与二维投影的区别及边界条件","beats":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"当固定高度为 z=h 时，截线上的点必须同时满足曲面方程 z=x²+y² 和截面方程 z=h。联立两式，就得到代数方程 x²+y²=h。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:2:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-02-moment-01-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\begin{cases} z = x^2 + y^2 \\\\ z = h \\end{cases} \\implies x^2 + y^2 = h"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:2:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-02-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"x^2 + y^2 = h \\implies r = \\sqrt{h} \\quad (h \\ge 0)"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-02-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:2:1:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01"],"intent":"推导截线方程"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"将 x²+y²=h 对照圆的标准方程 x²+y²=r²，容易得到 r²=h。当 h>0 时，解出半径 r=√h。注意，空间中的截线是位于平面 z=h 上的圆，其圆心在 (0,0,h)；而 xy 平面上的投影圆删去了 z 坐标，圆心为 (0,0)。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:2:2:1","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-02:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"我们来看边界条件：当 h=0 时，r=0，截线退化为单点原点 (0,0,0)；当 h<0 时，方程 x²+y²=h 在实数范围内无解，曲面与截面没有实交点。因此高度 h 的取值范围要求 h≥0。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:2:3:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01"],"intent":"分析 h≥0 边界条件与退化点"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-03","purpose":"通过高度变化演示验证半径预测，理解动态投影与整体等高线图的关系","beats":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"在前一小节的代数推导中，我们得到了半径与高度的关系 r等于根号h。现在我们来验证这个结论：如果我把高度 h 从 1 升高到 4，请大家先在心中预测一下，投影圆的半径会变为原来的几倍？","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:3:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01"],"intent":"引导学习者根据公式预测高度从1增加到4时半径的变化"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-03:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"我现在把高度 h 从 1 逐渐调到 4，请仔细观察三维截面与二维投影圆的变化。可以看到，当 h 达到 4 时，半径 r 确实从 1 变为了 2，刚好扩大为原来的 2 倍，完全符合 r等于根号h 的推导。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:3:2:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":4,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-03:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"接着，我把高度 h 降到边界值 0。此时截平面与曲面在顶点相切，平面本身不退化，投影圆的半径变为 0，在 xy 平面上退化为一个单点。这就是 h等于0 时的极限边界特征。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:3:3:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":0,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-03:beat:moment-04","narration":{"text":"需要注意，不同高度 h 对应的投影同心圆共同构成了曲面的整体等高线图。而我们当前的动态画面在每一个时刻只展示了一个特定的 h 截面，并非一次性呈现完整的等高线族。下一课我们将固定输入变量 x 或 y，探索垂直截线带来的偏导数视角。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:3:4:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-02-moment-01-item-02"],"intent":"继续观察当前画面"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3","sequence":4,"step":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-04","purpose":"总结固定输出高度的方法，并开放课后针对半径反推高度的练习","beats":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:step:section-04:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"总结一下，固定输出高度 z 等于常量，本质上是在曲面上用水平平面去切割，得到空间截线，并在 xy 平面上形成等高线。下一节课，我们将改为固定输入变量，例如固定 y 的值，去观察曲面的垂直截线。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:action:4:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01"],"intent":"总结固定输出高度与预告垂直截线"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.close","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3","sequence":5,"result":{"summary":"本课程讲解了如何通过固定输出高度 z=h，将三维曲面 z=x²+y² 化简为平面圆 x²+y²=h 及其投影圆。在 h≥0 时半径 r=√h。下一课我们将尝试固定输入变量 y，观察垂直截线的特征。","summary_node_refs":[],"suggested_focus":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.2.3:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01"]}}
